  "ruleText": "Plc 1102.10 “Structural integrator” means a practitioner providing structural integration in accordance with the scope of practice described in RSA 328-H:3, II, reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1100) #13391, eff 5-27-22; ss by #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36 (formerly Plc 1102.13)",
